title: alice_intro_stub
---
<<present_speaker "npc_alice">>
<<portrait_clip "speaking">>
<<if condition("world.flag_set", "bob_field_survey_received")>>
    Alice: Bob's survey. Good. The low route is still clear. Fold it different when you put it away.
    -> What now?
        <<jump alice_after_bob_survey__1>>
    -> ⟨leave⟩
<<elseif condition("world.flag_set", "alice_route_note_carried")>>
    Alice: Bob is up the low route. Give him the note, not me.
    -> ⟨leave⟩
<<else>>
    Alice: Put the official map away. Patrols use the same one.
    -> Take the note.
        <<jump alice_intro_stub__1>>
    -> Why are the patrols using your map?
        Alice: Someone asked us to mark the passages under the gate stack. Said it was for repairs.
        Alice: Bob checked the name on the request. There wasn't one.
    -> ⟨step back⟩
<<endif>>
===

title: alice_intro_stub__1
---
<<present_speaker "npc_alice">>
<<portrait_clip "speaking">>
Alice: Take this to Bob. Keep it folded until you're out of sight.
<<give_item "sealednote" 1>>
<<command "world.set_flag" "alice_route_note_carried" true>>
-> ⟨pocket the note⟩
===

title: alice_after_bob_survey__1
---
<<present_speaker "npc_alice">>
<<portrait_clip "speaking">>
Alice: Keep Bob's pencil marks. The printed routes are watched; his aren't.
-> Did you hear about the basement raid?
    Alice: I heard them arguing over a street number. By morning the room was empty.
    Alice: Give me Bob's notes. I'll see which of the other addresses they were supposed to visit.
-> ⟨step through⟩
===

title: bob_intro_stub
---
<<if condition("inventory.holds", "sealednote")>>
    Bob: That's Alice's fold. Hand it here. ...You came through the low route? Huh. Good.
    -> Hand him the sealed note.
        <<sell_item "sealednote" 0>>
        <<give_item "fieldsurvey" 1>>
        <<command "world.set_flag" "bob_field_survey_received" true>>
        <<jump bob_intro_stub__1>>
    -> ⟨keep it folded⟩
<<else>>
    Bob: Alice sent you? Then she gave you a folded note. Bring it here when you have it.
    -> Why are you up here?
        <<jump bob_intro_stub__2>>
    -> ⟨leave him to it⟩
<<endif>>
===

title: bob_intro_stub__1
---
Bob: Take this back to Alice. Tell her somebody's watching the low route now.
-> What did you find?
    Bob: Two copies of the same patrol map. One has a door marked a block north.
    Bob: The ink's fresh on both. I put a circle round it for Alice.
-> ⟨pocket the survey⟩
===

title: bob_intro_stub__2
---
Bob: Don't copy that bit. I haven't checked it yet. Actually, don't copy the stairs either.
-> ⟨move on⟩
===

title: creator_final_fast
