title: creator_intro
---
Creator: Hey. Eyes open. Can you move?
-> ...
    <<jump creator_intro__1>>
-> Where am I?
    <<jump creator_intro__2>>
-> ⟨turn toward the hatch⟩
===

title: creator_intro__1
---
Creator: Good. Move your left leg. I need to know the joints survived.
-> Ask again.
    <<jump creator_intro>>
-> ⟨move⟩
===

title: creator_intro__2
---
Creator: My basement. Those boots upstairs are not mine. Stay away from the door.
-> Ask again.
    <<jump creator_intro>>
-> ⟨move⟩
===

title: intro_lab_raider
---
Lab Raider: Prototype is awake. Keep it away from the doors.
-> ⟨stand still⟩
    <<jump intro_lab_raider__1>>
-> ⟨back away⟩
===

title: intro_lab_raider__1
---
Lab Raider: This room wasn't on the list. Get the prototype away from the door.
-> ⟨escape⟩
===

title: gate_janitor_ripple
---
Gate Janitor: Mind the wet patch. Maintenance has this corridor today, so half the signs are turned around.
-> What's that shimmer?
    <<jump gate_janitor_ripple__1>>
-> Where do the stable gates lead?
    <<jump gate_janitor_ripple__2>>
-> What do you actually do?
    <<jump gate_janitor_ripple__3>>
-> Who gets priority on a busy gate?
    <<jump gate_janitor_ripple__priority>>
-> ⟨move on⟩
===

title: gate_janitor_ripple__1
---
Gate Janitor: Don't touch the shimmer. It won't take you anywhere. Gate Six works; use that if you need a gate.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump gate_janitor_ripple>>
-> ⟨move on⟩
===

title: gate_janitor_ripple__2
---
Gate Janitor: Six goes to a beach. Seven goes to some meeting room. Eight still says Tuesday. I stopped asking.
Gate Janitor: Seven's on the Math line now. Its breaker's on the wall; throw it and Seven dials TANGENT, and nothing else.
<<command "world.set_flag" "gate.known.TANGENT" true>>
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump gate_janitor_ripple>>
-> ⟨move on⟩
===

title: gate_janitor_ripple__3
---
Gate Janitor: Six jammed twice this morning. Seven leaks blue light. I'm here until both stop doing that.
Gate Janitor: And I mop. People walk out of a ring and lose breakfast. Robots never do. I like robots.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump gate_janitor_ripple>>
-> ⟨move on⟩
===

title: manifest_kiosk_wrong_list
---
Manifest Clerk: Name? ...No entry. Spell it again. Slower.
-> Run a manifest query.
    <<jump manifest_kiosk_wrong_list__1>>
-> Who was the actual target?
    <<jump manifest_kiosk_wrong_list__2>>
-> Who else has the manifest?
    <<jump manifest_kiosk_wrong_list__copies>>
-> ⟨step away⟩
===

title: manifest_kiosk_wrong_list__1
---
Manifest Clerk: Last night's list has one target. Large. Your basement is marked small. Somebody attached the wrong sheet.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump manifest_kiosk_wrong_list>>
-> ⟨step away⟩
===

title: manifest_kiosk_wrong_list__2
---
Manifest Clerk: I can't give you the target name. I can tell you the date on this form is wrong, and so is the room number. Next question.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump manifest_kiosk_wrong_list>>
-> ⟨step away⟩
===

title: intro_salvage_guard
---
Salvage Lead: Wrong room. Secure anything that boots. Keep the core intact. Mark the notebooks.
-> ⟨listen⟩
    <<jump intro_salvage_guard__1>>
-> ⟨escape⟩
===

title: intro_salvage_guard__1
---
Salvage Lead: This one isn't on the manifest. Tag it and move. The professor's logs come with us.
-> ⟨escape⟩
===

title: news_board_lab_incident
---
Drain Market Bulletin: ▸ SOLE FATALITY IDENTIFIED AS UNLICENSED RESEARCHER. AUTHORITIES THANK BOTH RESPONDING FACTIONS.
-> ⟨read further⟩
    <<jump news_board_lab_incident__1>>
-> ⟨walk away⟩
===

title: news_board_lab_incident__1
---
Drain Market Bulletin: ▸ AT TIME OF PRINTING THE RESEARCHER WAS POSTHUMOUSLY ADDED TO A VALID TARGET LIST. THE LIST ALSO POSTHUMOUSLY ADDED ITSELF.
-> ⟨leave the board to its work⟩
===

title: oiler_intro
---
<<present_speaker "npc_oiler">>
<<portrait_clip "talking">>
<<if condition("world.flag_set", "p1_stabilizer_received")>>
    Oiler: Stabilizer's yours. Knee should stop kicking sideways now. Don't drop it in the drain.
    -> What's below?
        <<jump oiler_post_stabilizer__1>>
    -> Who else can fix my joints?
        Oiler: Faith Knoss. Folks call her Fia. She's helping with the gate lifts today.
        Oiler: If the stabilizer starts grinding, bring it to either of us.
    -> ⟨move on⟩
<<else>>
    Oiler: Well. You're bigger than the rats. Came through that pipe, did you?
    -> Who are you?
        <<jump oiler_intro__1>>
    -> What is this place?
        <<jump oiler_intro__2>>
    -> Why help me?
        <<jump oiler_intro__3>>
    -> Did you hear the raid?
        Oiler: Boots all over the service stairs. One of them was yelling that the room number was wrong.
        Oiler: I shut my workshop door. Come back later if you want me to look at that knee.
    -> ⟨keep walking⟩
<<endif>>
===

title: oiler_intro__1
---
<<present_speaker "npc_oiler">>
<<portrait_clip "talking">>
Oiler: Oiler. I fix pipes, knees, doors, whatever's leaking. Hold still if you want help.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump oiler_intro>>
-> ⟨keep walking⟩
===

title: oiler_intro__2
---
<<present_speaker "npc_oiler">>
<<portrait_clip "talking">>
Oiler: Drain Market. Gates are upstairs. Drains are down. My bench is the one with all the wrenches.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump oiler_intro>>
-> ⟨keep walking⟩
===

title: oiler_intro__3
---
<<present_speaker "npc_oiler">>
<<portrait_clip "inspecting">>
Oiler: That knee's crooked. Sit. Ten seconds. Then walk on it and tell me if it still kicks out.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump oiler_intro>>
-> ⟨keep walking⟩
===

title: oiler_post_stabilizer__1
---
<<present_speaker "npc_oiler">>
<<portrait_clip "talking">>
Oiler: Cartographers are below. Follow the drain until you see chalk all over the walls. Tell them Oiler sent you.
-> ⟨descend⟩
===

title: gate_janitor_ripple__priority
---
Gate Janitor: Medical, if the dispatcher reads the red tag. Military, when they come down and tell him to move aside.
Gate Janitor: I watched a box of spare boots go through while a man waited with medicine for his kid. I told him to file a complaint. He laughed at me.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump gate_janitor_ripple>>
-> ⟨move on⟩
===

title: manifest_kiosk_wrong_list__copies
---
Manifest Clerk: We keep one copy here and one at the checkpoint. I corrected the basement address on ours.
Manifest Clerk: The checkpoint sent it back marked DENIED. That's all I can show you.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump manifest_kiosk_wrong_list>>
-> ⟨step away⟩
===
